{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/tc/web_table.html?id=315-37001&api_popup=1"},"title":"國際收支平衡","tablenote":["由於數字經四捨五入，分項總和未必與總數相等。     經常賬戶或資本賬戶的差額為正數值代表盈餘，而負數值則代表赤字。     自2023年6月起，金融賬戶的整系數列已採用新的正負號常規。自此，資產／負債增加以正數值標示。注意：資產增加表示資金淨流出，而負債增加則表示資金淨流入。因此，金融賬戶差額增加（即資產減去負債為正數值）表示資金淨流出。     在國際收支平衡架構下儲備及非儲備資產的估計數字是指交易數字。因估值方式改變（包括價格變動及匯率變動）及重新分類所導致的影響並沒計算在內。","@ 數字在日後會作出修訂。"],"source":"政府統計處國際收支平衡統計科 (一)  (查詢電話：3863 2329  查詢電郵：bop@censtatd.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":61,"started":"2026-10-20T20:02:02+00:00","finished":"2026-10-20T20:02:02+00:00","durationSeconds":0.123397}},"dataSet":[{"BOP_COMPONENT":"BOP_C","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"整體的國際收支","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":-40165,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CPA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"資本賬戶","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":-38,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CRA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"經常賬戶","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":22226,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DI","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"直接投資","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":20806,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"FA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"金融賬戶","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":11027,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"FD","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"金融衍生工具","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":-25550,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"FNRA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"非儲備金融資產","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":51192,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"G","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"貨物","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":127920,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"NEO","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"淨誤差及遺漏","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":-11161,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"OI","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"其他投資","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":22